    "en": [
      "The postcard features a sepia-toned portrait of an elderly man in traditional Cretan clothing, seated and holding a komboloi (worry beads). He wears a traditional headpiece and vest. The photograph is centered on a white card with Greek text printed below the image, and there is a circular seal-like logo on the bottom left and a website address at the bottom."
